    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2VvsAv9bMnVw5hmscGggixs)_\n\n## What\nTwo sections for `docs/tangles/ui/sp-posframe.org`. They were meant for #156 but were pushed after it merged, so they come as a separate pull request.\n\n- **How it got here: the attempts.** A table of 20 commits from #114 to #154, each linked to its pull request and commit, with what it tried, and what the history shows (including the `*Minibuf-1*` window that was never explained).\n- **Rebuilding the setup from zero.** One addition per pull request (text size, width, prompt look, dotted line, optional dimming), the Vertico options to use instead of face remaps and overlays, and the checks each step should pass. The backtrace advice and the state dump used here are included so they can be pasted back in.\n\nDocs and CHANGELOG only; no code changes.\n\n## Not tested\nNothing was run in Emacs (none in the container). The plan is a recommendation from reading the code and the history, not something tried.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBs9srTW9kUiGXduSF)_",
